  "bodyHash": "AphMhsXOIlo=",
  "content": "请提供需要翻译的文本。<br>\n\n<center>\n\t<img title=\"Friends&amp;Foes\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/logo.png\" alt=\"Friends&amp;Foes\" width=\"836\">\n</center>\n\n<br>\n\n<center>\n\t<a style=\"text-decoration: none;\" href=\"https://ko-fi.com/faboslav\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=请我喝杯咖啡&color=5b9c51&labelColor=5b9c51&logoColor=ffffff&style=for-the-badge&logo=ko-fi\" alt=\"请我喝杯咖啡\">\n\t</a>\n\t<a style=\"text-decoration: none;\" href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Faboslav\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=成为赞助者&color=5b9c51&labelColor=5b9c51&logoColor=ffffff&style=for-the-badge&logo=patreon\" alt=\"Patreon\">\n\t</a>\n\t<a style=\"text-decoration: none;\" href=\"https://discord.gg/QGwFvvMQCn\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/924964658169913404?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=ffffff&label=加入我们的Discord&labelColor=5b9c51&color=5b9c51\" alt=\"加入我们的Discord\">\n\t</a>\n\t<a style=\"text-decoration: none;\" href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Wiki&logoColor=ffffff&style=for-the-badge&logo=github&labelColor=5b9c51&color=5b9c51\" alt=\"Wiki\">\n\t</a>\n</center>\n\n<br>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\tFriends&amp;Foes 增加了来自生物投票中被淘汰和被遗忘的生物。其主要目标之一是在原有概念基础上进一步拓展，并添加与所有生物相关的新原版风格特性。\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t你可以查看<a title=\"wiki\" href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki\">Wiki</a>了解已实现生物和特性的详细概述。\n</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<h1>\n\t<img title=\"螃蟹\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/crab.gif\" alt=\"螃蟹\" width=\"60\">\n\t<span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>\n\t<span>螃蟹</span>\n</h1>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t介绍<a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Crab\">螃蟹</a>，一种友善的生物，在红树林沼泽和海滩上漫步。\n\t想要延长你的触及范围？可以用蟹爪制作一种药水，增加你的触及范围，为你的冒险带来宝贵的优势。\n\t如果你想<a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Crab#breeding\">繁殖</a>这个小家伙，你需要海带和耐心，因为螃蟹需要将蛋“埋”在安全的地方。\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/crab_1.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/crab_1.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"挥舞钳子的螃蟹\" title=\"挥舞钳子的螃蟹\">\n\t</a>\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/crab_2.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/crab_2.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"螃蟹爬红树林\" title=\"螃蟹爬红树林\">\n\t</a>\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t与螃蟹相关的其他特性：\n</p>\n<ul style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Craw-Claw\">蟹爪</a>物品</li>\n\t<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Reaching\">触及</a>状态效果</li>\n</ul>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<h1>\n\t<img title=\"凝灰岩傀儡\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/tuff_golem.gif\" alt=\"凝灰岩傀儡\" width=\"40\">\n\t<span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>\n\t<span>凝灰岩傀儡</span>\n</h1>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t<a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Tuff-Golem\">凝灰岩傀儡</a>，一种雕像般的生物，可以拿取并展示你给它的任何物品，但小心，当它不睡觉时，它喜欢自发地散步。\n\t想让你的凝灰岩傀儡固定不动？用<a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Tuff-Golem#glueing\">蜜脾</a>把它固定住。如果你想<a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Tuff-Golem#creation\">建造</a>这个睡美人，收集一个凝灰岩块、一个任意<a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Tuff-Golem#dyeing\">颜色</a>的羊毛块和一个南瓜。\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/tuff_golem_1.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/tuff_golem_1.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"拿着附魔书的凝灰岩傀儡\" title=\"拿着附魔书的凝灰岩傀儡\">\n\t</a>\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/tuff_golem_2.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/tuff_golem_2.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"睡着的凝灰岩傀儡\" title=\"睡着的凝灰岩傀儡\">\n\t</a>\n</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<h1>\n\t<img title=\"小淘气\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/rascal.gif\" alt=\"小淘气\" width=\"40\">\n\t<span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>\n\t<span>小淘气</span>\n</h1>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t发现<a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Rascal\">小淘气</a>，一种位于矿洞中的顽皮小生物，它喜欢玩捉迷藏的游戏。\n\t它既好玩又有帮助，在你寻找它时会给你提示。\n\t找到它三次，它就会奖励你梦想中的收纳袋！\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/rascal_1.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/rascal_1.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"矿洞中的小淘气\" title=\"矿洞中的小淘气\">\n\t</a>\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/rascal_2.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/rascal_2.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"小淘气扔出收纳袋\" title=\"小淘气扔出收纳袋\">\n\t</a>\n</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<h1>\n\t<img title=\"铜傀儡\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/copper_golem.gif\" alt=\"铜傀儡\" width=\"40\">\n\t<span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>\n\t<span>铜傀儡</span>\n</h1>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t认识<a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Copper-Golem\">铜傀儡</a>，一个袖珍、滑稽的奇迹，它喜欢随机按动铜按钮。\n\t像其他铜制物品一样，它会随着时间<a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Copper-Golem#oxidation\">氧化</a>，但别担心，维护起来非常方便！想要快速翻新，就拿<a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Copper-Golem#scraping\">斧头</a>或<a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Copper-Golem#waxing\">蜜脾</a>。\n\t如果你想<a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Copper-Golem#creation\">建造</a>这个小家伙，需要收集一个铜块、一个南瓜和一个避雷针。\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/copper_golem_1.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/copper_golem_1.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"村庄中的铜傀儡工作站结构\" title=\"村庄中的铜傀儡工作站结构\">\n\t</a>\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/copper_golem_2.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/copper_golem_2.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"铜傀儡\" title=\"铜傀儡\">\n\t</a>\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t与铜傀儡相关的其他特性：\n</p>\n<ul style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Copper-Golem-Workstation\">铜傀儡工作站</a>村庄结构</li>\n\t<li>所有铜变种的<a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Copper-Button\">铜按钮</a></li>\n\t<li>所有铜变种的<a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Lightning-Rod\">避雷针</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<h1>\n\t<img style=\"height: 40px; margin-bottom: 0px;\" title=\"幽魂\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/glare.webp\" alt=\"幽魂\" width=\"40\">\n\t<span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>\n\t<span>幽魂</span>\n</h1>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t介绍<a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Glare\">幽魂</a>，一种居住在繁茂洞穴中、脾气暴躁又可爱的苔藓同伴，它讨厌黑暗。\n\t你也讨厌黑暗吗？如果是这样，幽魂可以为你指出足够黑暗、可能生成怪物的区域。\n\t如果你想<a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Glare#taming\">驯服</a>或<a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Glare#breeding\">繁殖</a>这个小可爱，你需要发光浆果，但要小心，幽魂经常偷吃它们，不留任何残渣。\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/glare_1.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/glare_1.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"幼年和成年幽魂\" title=\"幼年和成年幽魂\">\n\t</a>\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/glare_2.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/glare_2.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"在繁茂洞穴中飞翔的幽魂\" title=\"在繁茂洞穴中飞翔的幽魂\">\n\t</a>\n</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<h1>\n\t<img title=\"冰术师\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/iceologer.webp\" alt=\"冰术师\" width=\"25\">\n\t<span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>\n\t<span>冰术师</span>\n</h1>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t遭遇<a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Iceologer\">冰术师</a>，一个孤独的灾厄村民，深居雪地之中。\n\t你可以在树林中寻找一个小型云杉<a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Iceologer-Cabin\">小木屋</a>来找到他。\n\t但在冒险中要小心，因为多年的野外生活使他的心比周围的冰还要寒冷。如果它发现你，准备好迎接<a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Iceologer-Cabin\">冰冻攻击</a>，将你的冒险变成一场寒冷的挑战。\n</p>\t\n\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/iceologer_1.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/iceologer_1.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"雪地中的冰术师小木屋\" title=\"雪地中的冰术师小木屋\">\n\t</a>\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/iceologer_2.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/iceologer_2.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"冰术师攻击村民\" title=\"冰术师攻击村民\">\n\t</a>\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t与冰术师相关的其他特性：\n</p>\n<ul style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Iceologer-Cabin\">冰术师小木屋</a>结构</li>\n\t<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Totem-of-Freezing\">冰冻图腾</a>物品</li>\n</ul>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<h1>\n\t<img title=\"哔花\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/moobloom.webp\" alt=\"哔花\" width=\"40\">\n\t<span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>\n\t<span>哔花</span>\n</h1>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t呈现<a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Moobloom\">哔花</a>，一种沐浴阳光、身上覆盖着美丽花朵的牛，主要生活在繁花森林中。\n\t这些覆盖鲜花的同伴不仅赏心悦目，还能与蜜蜂和谐共生。\n\t哔花走过的地方会留下一片盛开的花丛，让每一步都成为穿越自然奇观的迷人旅程。\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/moobloom_1.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/moobloom_1.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"毛茛哔花\" title=\"毛茛哔花\">\n\t</a>\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/moobloom_2.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/moobloom_2.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"繁花哔花\" title=\"繁花哔花\">\n\t</a>\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t与哔花相关的其他特性：\n</p>\n<ul style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Buttercup\">毛茛</a>花</li>\n\t<li>所有木变种的<a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Beehives\">蜂箱</a></li>\n\t<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Beekeeper-Area\">养蜂人区域</a>村庄结构</li>\n\t<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Beekeeper\">养蜂人</a>村民职业</li>\n</ul>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<h1>\n\t<img title=\"野火\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/wildfire.webp\" alt=\"野火\" width=\"50\">\n\t<span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>\n\t<span>野火</span>\n</h1>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t<a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Wildfire\">野火</a>，烈焰人的主宰，受到四面盾牌的保护。\n\t这场遭遇并不友好，小心它的盾牌碎片弹幕和地震般的冲击波攻击。\n\t当被逼入绝境时，它会召唤烈焰人增援。在它的<a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Citadel\">堡垒</a>领域中，运用策略征服挑战，对抗这个火焰哨兵。\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/wildfire_1.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/wildfire_1.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"下界中的堡垒结构\" title=\"下界中的堡垒结构\">\n\t</a>\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/wildfire_2.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/wildfire_2.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"堡垒中的野火\" title=\"堡垒中的野火\">\n\t</a>\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t与野火相关的其他特性：\n</p>\n<ul style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Citadel\">堡垒</a>结构</li>\n\t<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Wildfire-Crown\">野火皇冠</a>物品</li>\n\t<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Wildfire-Crown-Fragment\">野火皇冠碎片</a>物品</li>\n</ul>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<h1>\n\t<img title=\"吞噬者（大胃口）\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/mauler.webp\" alt=\"吞噬者\" width=\"40\">\n\t<span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>\n\t<span>吞噬者（大胃口）</span>\n</h1>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t介绍<a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Mauler-(The-Great-Hunger)\">吞噬者</a>，一种小型的掠食者，在热带草原、恶地和沙漠中游荡。它们的目标是鸡、兔等生物。\n\t你可以喂食它们附魔物品来<a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Mauler-(The-Great-Hunger)#storing-and-extracting-experience-points\">存储经验值</a>，之后再使用玻璃瓶提取。但要小心，经验值越多，吞噬者就会变得越大越饿！\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/mauler_1.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/mauler_1.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"吞噬者猎鸡\" title=\"吞噬者猎鸡\">\n\t</a>\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/mauler_2.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/mauler_2.webp\" width=\"49.4%\"  alt=\"喂食后的吞噬者\" title=\"喂食后的吞噬者\">\n\t</a>\n</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<h1>\n\t<img title=\"幻术师\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/illusioner.webp\" alt=\"幻术师\" width=\"25\">\n\t<span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>\n\t<span>幻术师</span>\n</h1>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t遭遇<a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Illusioner\">幻术师</a>，一个狡猾的骗子，手持弓，生活在针叶林中。你可以通过寻找一个小棚屋或它的训练场来找到它。\n\t接近时要小心，因为<a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Illusioner#casting-blindness\">致盲法术</a>可能让你陷入黑暗，难以分辨<a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Illusioner#summoning-illusions\">幻影</a>与现实。\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/illusioner_1.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/illusioner_1.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"针叶林中的幻术师棚屋\" title=\"针叶林中的幻术师棚屋\">\n\t</a>\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/illusioner_2.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/illusioner_2.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"训练场中的幻术师\" title=\"训练场中的幻术师\">\n\t</a>\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t与幻术师相关的其他特性：\n</p>\n<ul style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Illusioner-Shack\">幻术师棚屋</a>结构</li>\n\t<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Totem-of-Illusion\">幻术图腾</a>物品</li>\n</ul>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<h1>\n\t<img title=\"僵尸马（陷阱）\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/zombie_horse.webp\" alt=\"僵尸马（陷阱）\" width=\"50\">\n\t<span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>\n\t<span>僵尸马（陷阱）</span>\n</h1>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t曾经想骑<a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Zombie-Horse-(Trap)\">僵尸马</a>吗？如果是这样，在雷暴天气接近一匹，奇迹就可能发生——你甚至可能瞥见天启四骑士。\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/zombie_horse_1.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/zombie_horse_1.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"雷暴中的僵尸马\" title=\"雷暴中的僵尸马\">\n\t</a>\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/zombie_horse_2.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/zombie_horse_2.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"雷暴中的天启四骑士\" title=\"雷暴中的天启四骑士\">\n\t</a>\n</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<h1>⚙️ 兼容性 / 扩展包</h1>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\tFriends&Foes 旨在与所有其他模组完全兼容，目前提供少量扩展包和数据包：\n</p>\n\n<ul style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms-forge\">Friends&Foes - 繁花哔花</a></li>\n\t<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/friends-and-foes-beekeeper-hut-forge\">Friends&Foes - 养蜂人小屋</a></li>\n\t<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/repurposed-structures-friends-and-foes-datapack\">Repurposed Structures - Friends and Foes 兼容数据包</a></li>\n\t<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/datapack/ctov-friends-and-foes-compat\">CTOV - Friends and Foes 兼容数据包</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<h1>💬 社区</h1>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t欢迎<a href=\"https://discord.gg/QGwFvvMQCn\">加入我们的Discord服务器社区</a>，聊天、分享你的创作、提出任何问题，或者只是了解模组的最新开发动态，并在新版本发布时获得通知。\n\t也欢迎<a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/issues\">通过GitHub问题报告任何崩溃或错误</a>。\n</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<h1>👋 支持</h1>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t我会继续将模组开发作为一项爱好，因为我真的乐在其中。如果你想支持我，可以在<a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Faboslav\">Patreon</a>或<a href=\"https://ko-fi.com/faboslav\">Ko-fi</a>上支持我。非常感谢你的支持。\n</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<h1>📜 许可证</h1>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t本模组采用<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/LICENSE.txt\">CC BY-NC-ND 4.0</a>许可证。\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t欢迎随意查阅我的代码，了解我在开发此模组时如何解决各种挑战。你可以将代码片段用于你自己的项目中。同时，欢迎在任何整合包中使用本模组（如果注明出处并链接回此页面，将不胜感激）。\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t你也可以查看<a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/tree/master/blockbench\">blockbench目录</a>，其中包含所有模型和调色板，以及<a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/tree/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/friendsandfoes/textures\">纹理目录</a>获取纹理。获取灵感，但请不要直接复制粘贴作为己用。\n</p>",
